    "q-280382": {
      "dom_id": "step-q280382",
      "name": "Question 11",
      "problem": "Consider the following parabola:\n\n$$\nx=15{t}^{2},\\,y=3t,\\,t\\in (-\\infty ,\\infty )\n$$\n\nThe Cartesian equation of the parabola is\n\n${y}^{2}=$\n{{field-1}}.",
      "worked_solution": "First, let's make $t$ the subject of the parametric equations. This gives\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{t}^{2} & =\\frac{x}{15},\\,t=\\frac{y}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSquaring both sides of the second equation, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{t}^{2} & =\\frac{{y}^{2}}{9}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nWe can now eliminate the parameter $t$ by substituting the above into the equation ${t}^{2}=\\frac{x}{15}$ and rearranging to find the Cartesian equation of the parabola, as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}\\frac{{y}^{2}}{9} & =\\frac{x}{15} \\\\ {y}^{2} & =\\frac{3}{5}x\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, the Cartesian equation of the parabola is ${y}^{2}=\\frac{3}{5}x.$",
      "calculator_instructions": "",
      "fields": [
        {
          "key": "field-1",
          "type": "blank",
          "dom_id": "freeResponseTextbox-1",
          "tag": "mathquill",
          "choices": [],
          "dom_index": 0,
          "disabled": false,
          "input_html": "<div id=\"freeResponseTextbox-1\" class=\"matheditor-wrapper-answer\" ;=\"\" style=\"min-width:40px;\n                                        margin-left:2px;\n                                        margin-right:1px;\n                                        background:;\"><div class=\"mq-editable-field mq-math-mode\" style=\"border: none; outline: none;\"><span class=\"mq-textarea\"><textarea autocapitalize=\"off\" autocomplete=\"off\" autocorrect=\"off\" spellcheck=\"false\" x-palm-disable-ste-all=\"true\" style=\"\" disabled=\"\"></textarea></span><span class=\"mq-root-block\" mathquill-block-id=\"113\"><span class=\"mq-fraction mq-non-leaf\" mathquill-command-id=\"115\"><span class=\"mq-numerator\" mathquill-block-id=\"117\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"116\">3</span></span><span class=\"mq-denominator\" mathquill-block-id=\"119\"><span mathquill-command-id=\"118\">5</span></span><span style=\"display:inline-block;width:0\">​</span></span><var mathquill-command-id=\"121\">x</var></span></div></div>",
          "rendered_text": "35​x",
